    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Fables is a deck-builder with a strong roguelite component: strengthen your deck, create synergies, and face powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be accessible to all types of players, with easy-to-understand (but difficult to master!) mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also various game modes, designed for faster-paced games, where you can have a defined strategy in just a few minutes. Or even fight directly against a final boss with a pseudo-randomized deck.<br><br>2D art by Miguel Noguera, original music by Oliver Moya, and logo design by Ricardo Garc\u00eda.</p>",
